id: SHELL1-8
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: shell_frame_host
target: crates/web/static/app.css
find: [data-testid="pane-tabs"][data-pane="ops"] ~ .sh-panes > #pane-artifacts,
replace: [data-testid="pane-tabs"][data-pane="ops"] ~ .sh-panes > #pane-artifactz,
expect-fail: css_hides_unselected_pane_below_960px
note: 操作を選んだときに成果物の領域が 960px 未満で隠れない（SHELL-1・TASK-517 2/2）
